  abilityDesc: 40 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    boosts spark damage for 3 turns, raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, boosts
    Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns, fills BB gauge to max & 3 turns Atk, Def reduction
    infliction
